Package: pxlogic-pxview
Architecture: any
Depends:
 ${shlibs:Depends},
 ${misc:Depends},
 python3
Description: PXView logic analyzer software
 PXView is a Qt-based signal analysis application for PXLogic USB logic
 analyzers and a wide range of third-party instruments supported by
 libsigrok.
 .
 Features include logic analyzer, oscilloscope and mixed-signal capture,
 more than 220 protocol decoders, raw and decoded data export, USB hotplug
 support, and a headless daemon (pxviewd) for automated capture.
